'''Mesagoza''' (Japanese: '''テーブルシティ''' ''Table City'') is a {{TCGP|Stadium card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Stadium
|rule=SV Stadium
|effect=Once during each player's turn, that player may flip a coin. If heads, that player puts a random Pokémon from their deck into their hand.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is similar to the {{TCG|Mesagoza}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but the Pokémon card selected is random, rather than the player's choice.

===Origin===
* [[Mesagoza]] is a location in [[Paldea]].
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Mesagoza|178}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.

